  "body": "### What is the issue with the URL Pattern Standard?\n\nURLPattern doesn't tolerate `+` in protocol. The polyfill gives this error:\r\n\r\n```\r\nnew URLPattern(\"web+foo://example.com/baz\")\r\n\r\nTypeError: Failed to construct 'URLPattern': Unexpected OTHER_MODIFIER at 3, expected END\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is especially a problem since the `web+` prefix is [mandatory](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator/registerProtocolHandler#permitted_schemes) when registering schemes.",
